    {
      "id": 37691573997588,
      "content": "Could you please check if your site's firewall or security plugins might be blocking the connection? Sometimes these can interfere with Jetpack's connection process.\n\nSupport Agent\nSupport Agent\n**| Automattic | WordPress.com**",
